  "display_name": "Kaitoi Studio",
  "description": "Discover nodes, inspect and run creative-production workflows, and manage Kaitoi Studio projects and assets.",
  "long_description": "Kaitoi Studio exposes its hosted workflow engine through authenticated MCP. Agents can discover nodes, inspect and build graphs, start durable runs and read their results, work with projects and assets, and retrieve API contracts. Unattached clients use a separate account-scoped server graph. An open Studio canvas requires an explicitly selected, opted-in attachment when supported. Available tools, profiles, optional integrations and UI features depend on the deployed server, account permissions and OAuth scopes; authenticated discovery is authoritative. Provider-backed execution may consume existing credits and provider allowances.",
